abstract: "Companion implementation and selected experimental statistics for Beyond Accuracy: Consequence-Aware Semantic Occupancy Evaluation and Training for Autonomous Driving. Raw datasets, trained checkpoints and complete packages for Tables I, V and VI are not included. Statistical evidence and new documentation use CC-BY-4.0; code retains Apache-2.0 and bundled third-party notices."
